# Bot1 flashes The Wandering Emperor in during Bot2's combat on turn two and makes a Samurai at once (CR 606.3 as
# she allows). The -1 resolves and Bot1 gets priority again with the stack empty, still in the turn she entered, but
# no second loyalty ability is offered: one loyalty activation per permanent per turn (CR 606.3), and her static
# ability only changes the timing. It stays refused in the end step.
#
# On Bot1's own turn three the +1 is activated at sorcery speed as usual. On Bot2's turn four she did not enter this
# turn, so her loyalty abilities are sorcery-speed again and none is offered while Bot2 is the active player.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
The Wandering Emperor
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

